Package: hqcam
Version: 0.1.25
Section: video
Priority: optional
Architecture: armhf
Maintainer: SodaPop Admin <Admin@SodaPopSystems.com>
Depends: rpicam-apps | libcamera-apps, network-manager, dnsmasq-base, rsync, openssh-client, iw, usbutils, libturbojpeg0, curl
Description: Coastal HQ CSI camera MJPEG streaming server
 Captures from the Raspberry Pi CSI camera via rpicam-vid and serves an
 MJPEG stream on port 6877 for the HQ Motion Eye system. Installs the
 hqcam binary and systemd service, a WiFi fallback hotspot for vehicle
 access, offline recording to a USB drive, and footage sync back to HQ.
